  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "A hash set gives expected linear time but can hold up to n different numbers, that is O of n extra space.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 8700,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 261,
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "And the question allows only constant extra space.",
      "start_ms": 9380,
      "end_ms": 13000,
      "start_frame": 281,
      "end_frame": 390,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "So we cannot carry a separate set into the final solution.",
      "start_ms": 13380,
      "end_ms": 17080,
      "start_frame": 401,
      "end_frame": 512,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "We still need to know which positive values exist.",
      "start_ms": 17720,
      "end_ms": 21160,
      "start_frame": 532,
      "end_frame": 635,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Could the original array positions hold that information for us?",
      "start_ms": 22140,
      "end_ms": 27040,
      "start_frame": 664,
      "end_frame": 811,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Without another data structure?",
      "start_ms": 27040,
      "end_ms": 29460,
      "start_frame": 811,
      "end_frame": 884,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start_ms": 30420,
      "end_ms": 30800,
      "start_frame": 913,
      "end_frame": 924,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To do that, we first need one important bound.",
      "start_ms": 31920,
      "end_ms": 36160,
      "start_frame": 958,
      "end_frame": 1085,
      "word_count": 9
    }
  ],
